<rss version="2.0" xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/"><channel><title>财富|财富</title><link>https://fortune.com</link><description>财富 500 强日报和突发商业新闻</description><lastBuildDate>Tue, 15 Sep 2026 15:49:55 GMT</lastBuildDate><generator>rfeed v1.1.1</generator><docs>https://github.com/svpino/rfeed/blob/master/README.md</docs><item><title>百万富翁 Z 世代网球明星埃琳娜·瑞巴基娜 (Elena Rybakina) 拒绝了 15 所大学，继续打网球——这违背了她父亲的意愿。现在她不是了。世界 1 个</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/15/millionaire-gen-z-tennis-star-elena-rybakina-turned-down-15-colleges-against-dads-wishes-number-1-in-world/</link><description>美国公开赛冠军埃琳娜·瑞巴基娜 (Elena Rybakina) 放弃了大学学业并改变了国籍，以实现她的网球梦想。现在她的收入为 1140 万美元。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/GettyImages-2294952047-e1789482901993.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Tue, 15 Sep 2026 14:47:47 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/15/millionaire-gen-z-tennis-star-elena-rybakina-turned-down-15-colleges-against-dads-wishes-number-1-in-world/</guid></item><item><title>数字货架标签应该可以为购物者省钱。新泽西州的一项新法律规定，他们可以采取相反的做法，并将其冻结一年</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/15/new-jersey-digital-shelf-labels-moratorium-walmart/</link><description>新泽西州的《公平价格保护法》规定，在该州研究新电子货架标签期间，将暂停使用新的电子货架标签一年。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/GettyImages-2281281531-e1789482863235.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Tue, 15 Sep 2026 14:37:29 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/15/new-jersey-digital-shelf-labels-moratorium-walmart/</guid></item><item><title>无薪“试工”是对最无力负担的候选人征收的新就业市场税</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/15/why-are-more-companies-doing-unpaid-work-trial-as-part-of-interview-process/</link><description>公司越来越倾向于通过工作试验来在充斥着人工智能优化简历和求职信的就业市场中寻找合格的候选人。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/GettyImages-2203399905-e1789482003276.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Tue, 15 Sep 2026 14:22:42 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/15/why-are-more-companies-doing-unpaid-work-trial-as-part-of-interview-process/</guid></item><item><title>沃尔玛继承人奥利维亚·沃尔顿 (Olivia Walton) 和汤姆·沃尔顿 (Tom Walton) 承诺为美国孕产妇死亡危机捐款 1 亿美元，并押注各州和捐助者将投入更多资金</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/15/walmart-heirs-olivia-and-tom-walton-donating-100-million-to-halve-americas-maternal-death-rate/</link><description>这对夫妇将其视为种子资金，希望各州和其他捐助者能够将其倍增，以应对孕产妇死亡危机。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/GettyImages-2275165632-e1789406303410.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Tue, 15 Sep 2026 13:08:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/15/walmart-heirs-olivia-and-tom-walton-donating-100-million-to-halve-americas-maternal-death-rate/</guid></item><item><title>迈阿密是逃离纽约和洛杉矶的富人的奢华之都——现在，价值 1 亿美元的办公室配备了红外线桑拿房、干细胞诊所和维加斯式的代客泊车服务</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/13/miami-luxury-capital-for-rich-fleeing-new-york-la-100-million-office-infrared-saunas-stem-cell-clinic-vegas-style-valet/</link><description>罗伯特·里瓦尼 (Robert Rivani) 斥资 1 亿美元在迈阿密海滩进行了重建，押注了办公楼市场的萎缩，并表示在开业前 90% 的租金已被出租。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/RIVANI_HQ_AUG_2026_0016-1_4K-e1789155118760.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 13 Sep 2026 07:43:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/13/miami-luxury-capital-for-rich-fleeing-new-york-la-100-million-office-infrared-saunas-stem-cell-clinic-vegas-style-valet/</guid></item><item><title>AGIBOT联合创始人姚茂庆表示，人形机器人将在5年内迎来“GPT-3.5”时刻</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/14/humanoids-gpt-3-5-moment-agibot/</link><description>机器人舞蹈表演占据了头条新闻，但中国的人形机器人制造商正在竞相寻找在酒店和工厂的真正用途。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/55515292424_84848b1763_o.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Mon, 14 Sep 2026 08:15:03 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/14/humanoids-gpt-3-5-moment-agibot/</guid></item><item><title>独家：伟大的婴儿潮一代业务交接刚刚获得了自己的 Zestimate</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/15/baton-small-business-boomer-sales-chat-joglekar/</link><description>“我们最大的竞争对手不是试图出售小企业的其他人，”巴顿首席执行官查特·乔格卡 (Chat Joglekar) 告诉《财富》杂志。 “意识是我们最大的竞争。” &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/cc280ee6-2d3b-4df3-9f88-0757f17c9003.png?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Tue, 15 Sep 2026 11:00:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/15/baton-small-business-boomer-sales-chat-joglekar/</guid></item><item><title>截至 2026 年 9 月 14 日的当前油价</title><link>https://fortune.com/article/price-of-oil-09-14-2026/</link><description>当油价变化时，它会影响您的能源成本，甚至日常用品的价格。原因如下。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Price-of-Oil-September-14.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Mon, 14 Sep 2026 13:15:18 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/article/price-of-oil-09-14-2026/</guid></item><item><title>截至 2026 年 9 月 15 日的当前石油价格</title><link>https://fortune.com/article/price-of-oil-09-15-2026/</link><description>当油价变化时，它会影响您的能源成本，甚至日常用品的价格。原因如下。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Price-of-Oil-September-15.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Tue, 15 Sep 2026 13:00:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/article/price-of-oil-09-15-2026/</guid></item><item><title>马克·扎克伯格正在将他的思维外包给人工智能。这在他的新“个人人工智能代理”实验中得到了体现</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/15/ai-ceo-agents-risk-eliminating-productive-friction/</link><description>人工智能可以消除代价高昂的工作场所瓶颈，但领导者可能会失去做出更好决策的异议和竞争观点。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/GettyImages-2284934270-e1789419693639.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Tue, 15 Sep 2026 12:30:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">ht